  body: |
    # SPC household membership during temporary absence

    ## Authored interpretation

    The source separately describes when a temporarily absent person is treated as a member of the claimant’s household, referring to its own specified exceptions.

    ## Scope and boundaries

    DMG 077005 invokes regulation 5 and paragraphs 077006–077007. This is a household-membership question and is not identical to the claimant-payment question in 077001.

    ## Inspected source passages

    - [DMG 077005, PDF page 11](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6426e57e7de82b000c3133eb/dmg-ch07-06.pdf#page=11)
    - [DMG 077001, PDF page 8](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6426e57e7de82b000c3133eb/dmg-ch07-06.pdf#page=8)

    ## Evidence and review status

